The code is adapted from Martin Hahner et al.'s LiDAR fog simulation
(https://github.com/MartinHahner/LiDAR_fog_sim) and LiDAR snowfall simulation
(https://github.com/SysCV/LiDAR_snow_sim), which are distributed under CC BY-NC 4.0.

Snowflake particle files generated with this directory's sampler (coopfaultbench.injectors.snow_particles
writes them to a user cache directory) are output of CC BY-NC 4.0 code and are treated as covered by
the same licence.

The full legal code is at the URL above (CC BY-NC 4.0 section 3(a)(1)(C) allows providing the licence by
